  "message": "If you want me to apply your rules across **all** upcoming bookings, please upload screenshots for **all four** reservations: **NM1VX1, KC18K6, S61CZX, H8Q05L**.

If it’s easier, you can also start with just one or two—then I’ll process those first and we can do the rest afterward.

Either way, please make sure each screenshot shows (for every segment): flight number, date, origin/destination, and departure/arrival times."
}

